#HELPS
1 ALD RUHN~
Ald'ruhn is a dusty Redoran town under the southwestern slopes of Red Mountain
where curved buildings endure daily ash storms outside the looming Ghostfence.
The ancient shell of Skar holds noble manors as tall guard towers watch above,
and bonemold guards defend streets threatened by Blight and cliff racers.~
